    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in the mystical world of Lana, where ancient secrets and formidable challenges await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vast and Mysterious World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse diverse landscapes, from sun-drenched deserts to enigmatic temples, each filled with hidden secrets and rich lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/2ebe4fad2e3da28d20f43a6417308a42.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/2ebe4fad2e3da28d20f43a6417308a42.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/2ebe4fad2e3da28d20f43a6417308a42.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Challenging Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles that blend logic and creativity, unlocking pathways and uncovering the mysteries of ancient civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/c1ad224166065169cef148ba7cf82e73.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/c1ad224166065169cef148ba7cf82e73.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/c1ad224166065169cef148ba7cf82e73.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Diverse Adversaries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of foes, each with unique abilities and strategies, requiring quick reflexes and tactical thinking.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/06cb02befed764e4be7854d6b353984c.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/06cb02befed764e4be7854d6b353984c.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/06cb02befed764e4be7854d6b353984c.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Divine Powers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free imprisoned deities and harness their powers to enhance your abilities, granting new skills and advantages in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/822399eeac7ee8aea77fb579b0805b2c.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/822399eeac7ee8aea77fb579b0805b2c.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/822399eeac7ee8aea77fb579b0805b2c.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in the mystical world of Lana, where ancient secrets and formidable challenges await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vast and Mysterious World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse diverse landscapes, from sun-drenched deserts to enigmatic temples, each filled with hidden secrets and rich lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/2ebe4fad2e3da28d20f43a6417308a42.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/2ebe4fad2e3da28d20f43a6417308a42.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/2ebe4fad2e3da28d20f43a6417308a42.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Challenging Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles that blend logic and creativity, unlocking pathways and uncovering the mysteries of ancient civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/c1ad224166065169cef148ba7cf82e73.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/c1ad224166065169cef148ba7cf82e73.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/c1ad224166065169cef148ba7cf82e73.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Diverse Adversaries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of foes, each with unique abilities and strategies, requiring quick reflexes and tactical thinking.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/06cb02befed764e4be7854d6b353984c.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/06cb02befed764e4be7854d6b353984c.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/06cb02befed764e4be7854d6b353984c.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Divine Powers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free imprisoned deities and harness their powers to enhance your abilities, granting new skills and advantages in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/822399eeac7ee8aea77fb579b0805b2c.poster.avif?t=1742545286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/822399eeac7ee8aea77fb579b0805b2c.webm?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174020/extras/822399eeac7ee8aea77fb579b0805b2c.mp4?t=1742545286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
